<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia reports record cereals crop in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>Tunisia reports record cereals crop in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia had a record grain harvest of 2.87 million tonnes in the 1995/96 season, official sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Figures from the agriculture ministry showed the following production breakdown -</p>
<p>Durum wheat 1.71 million tonnes</p>
<p>Soft wheat 0.31 million tonnes</p>
<p>Barley 0.85 million tonnes.</p>
<p>Drought cut the harvest to 0.62 million tonnes in 1995 and 0.65 million tonnes in 1994.</p>
<p>Domestic cereals consumption was estimated at 2.2 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom 2161-787538</p>
